OL,3,ARAF pilots who ejected moments before
OL,4,Acrash expected to make full recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo pilots, a trainee and an
OL,7,Fexperienced professional, who ejected
OL,8,Fand parachuted out of their plane
OL,9,Fmoments before it crashed are expected
OL,10,Fto make a full recovery, the RAF has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe Hawk T2 aircraft had been flying
OL,14,Fout of the RAF Valley station on
OL,15,FAnglesey on Wednesday when it plummeted
OL,16,Fto the ground in the nearby
OL,17,FPencarnisiog area.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
