OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARAF pilots who ejected moments before
OL,4,Acrash expected to make full recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FHawk operations have been paused by the
OL,7,FRAF as a "precautionary measure" while
OL,8,Finvestigations into the crash are
OL,9,Fongoing - the Red Arrows are included
OL,10,Fin the pause as the aerobatics display
OL,11,Fteam use the T1.
OL,13,FOn Thursday, the RAF said the two
OL,14,Fpilots, who were treated for minor
OL,15,Finjuries, are "doing well" and are
OL,16,F"expected to make a full recovery".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
